# Title: Suspicious Schtasks Schedule Types
# ID: 24c8392b-aa3c-46b7-a545-43f71657fe98
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-09
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.execution, attack.t1053.005
# Description: Detects scheduled task creations or modification on a suspicious schedule type
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((((process_path="*\\schtasks.exe") OR (process_name="schtasks.exe")) AND ((process_exec="* ONLOGON *" OR process_exec="* ONSTART *" OR process_exec="* ONCE *" OR process_exec="* ONIDLE *"))) AND NOT (((process_exec="*NT AUT*" OR process_exec="* SYSTEM*" OR process_exec="*HIGHEST*"))))
